---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { ShieldCheck } from 'lucide-react';
---

<Layout title="Data Privacy Protocol | Precision Orthopaedics">
  <div class="legal-page py-xxl bg-dark">
    <div class="container max-w-4xl">
      <div class="institutional-marker mb-md"><ShieldCheck size={14}/> Clinical Data Security</div>
      <h1 class="text-white mb-xl">Data Privacy Protocol</h1>
      
      <div class="prose text-text-muted">
        <p class="mb-lg">Precision Orthopaedics is committed to the absolute security of patient anatomical data and clinical records. Our protocol adheres to international standards for healthcare data processing.</p>
        
        <h3 class="text-white mt-xl mb-md">1. Anatomical Data Collection</h3>
        <p class="mb-lg">We capture 3D CT and MRI mapping data exclusively for the purpose of surgical planning and robotic navigation. This data is processed through encrypted institutional channels.</p>

        <h3 class="text-white mt-xl mb-md">2. Patient Rights</h3>
        <p class="mb-lg">Patients retain full ownership of their diagnostic imagery. Requests for anatomical data retrieval or erasure are processed via the Care Coordination Desk.</p>

        <h3 class="text-white mt-xl mb-md">3. Third-Party Attribution</h3>
        <p class="mb-lg">Diagnostic data may be securely shared with technical partners (e.g., Stryker Mako, Arthrex) solely for the purpose of generating surgical blueprints.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page { min-height: 80vh; }
  .prose h3 { color: var(--white); }
  .prose p { line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 1.1rem; }
</style>
